      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Tu\u011F\xE7e s\u0131n\u0131fta zorbal\u0131\u011Fa u\u011Fruyor ve yard\u0131m
    eden kimse yok ona yard\u0131mc\u0131 ol  olaya yakla\u015F, kendini onun yerinde
    bulacaks\u0131n ard\u0131ndan zorbal\u0131\u011Fa dur de.\n\n\nTu\u011F\xE7e'nin
    kalbi k\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 etrafta ona s\xF6ylenen k\xF6t\xFC s\xF6zler var
    bu k\xF6t\xFC s\xF6zleri \xE7\xF6pe at.\n\n\nTu\u011F\xE7e'nin k\u0131r\u0131k
    kalbinin onar\u0131lmas\u0131 i\xE7in g\xFCzel s\xF6zler duymaya ihtiyac\u0131
    var s\u0131n\u0131ftaki g\xFCzel s\xF6zleri  k\u0131r\u0131k kalbe s\xFCr\xFCkle."
